# Zoho WorkDrive — team deliverables (Option 2 · human-gated)

**Agents (desktop · cloud):** After Phase 3 approval in chat, land the pack in **git** (`editorial-packs/[ID]/` or `statics/[ID]/`) with `SHIP.md` + captions + tracker row. **Do not** call Zoho APIs, use TrueSync write paths, or put `ZOHO_REFRESH_TOKEN` in Cloud Agent context.

**Automation:** When those files land on **`main`**, GitHub Action `siya-workdrive-phase3-live.yml` syncs **only changed** packs into `_API-DRY-RUN/04–07` (fresh team delivery folders; secrets `WORKDRIVE_DRYRUN_*_ID` already set). Manual dry-run/fail tests use the separate dry-run workflow.

**Humans:** Optional TrueSync browse / manual fix-up under:

```text
~/Library/CloudStorage/ZohoWorkDriveTrueSync-AmcareMedicalConsultancyIndiaPvtLtd/Common Folder/Siya Knowledge Editorial/
```

