## Captions (required in the git pack at Phase 3)

Ship platform-specific caption docs **alongside images** in the pack:
`captions/` and `ready-to-post/captions/`
Include: Instagram, Facebook, **LinkedIn Company only**, X/Twitter, Pinterest.
Also include `ALL-PLATFORMS.md` for one-file copy-paste.

**Do not produce Founder LinkedIn (Dr. Sneh / Dr. Swati) posts** unless explicitly requested.

## Precedence

`siya-visual-approval-gate.mdc` wins for chat timing. Live sync is Action-only after gates on `main`.

Do not sync secrets, `.env`, or the full `amcare-os` monorepo into WorkDrive.
